            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "மாசு — mācu — \"pollution; impurity\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நகரங்களில் காற்று மாசு அதிகமாகிவிட்டது. nakaraṅkaḷil kāṟṟu mācu atikamākiviṭṭatu. Air pollution has increased in the cities."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "காற்று மாசு (mācu) is air pollution."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "மாசு (mācu) is native Dravidian (DEDR 4792), \"a spot, a stain, a taint, dust\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
